sida, Rosalinde, Belinda, Desdemona, Cordelina, Ophelia, and Bianca II\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A naming tradition was begun in 1687.\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"a naming tradition begun in 1687\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 discovered three new rings in addition to eight older rings.\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"three new rings in addition to the \\\"older\\\" eight rings\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Uranus has a magnetic field tilted at 66 degrees off-axis and off-center.\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"a magnetic field tilted at 66 degrees off-axis and off-center\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Wind speeds in Uranus' atmosphere were as high as 450 km/h (72400 meters per hour).\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"wind speeds in Uranus' atmosphere as high as 450 km/h (72400 meters per hour)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The spacecraft found evidence of a boiling lake of water some 479 miles (900 kilometers) below the top cloud surface.\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"found evidence of a boiling lake of water some 479 miles (900 kilometers) below the top cloud surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Uranus' rings are extremely variable in thickness and transparency.\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"Its rings were found to be extremely variable in thickness and transparency\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 returned photos of Miranda, Oberon, Ariele, Umbrella, and Titan.\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"returned photos of Miranda, Oberon, Ariele, Umbrella, and Titan\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Miranda, Oberon, Ariele, Umbrella, and Titan are five of Uranus' smaller moons.\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"five of Uranus' smaller moons\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The spacecraft flew by Miranda at a range of 17.560 miles (28.260 kilometers).\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"flying by Miranda at a range of only 17.560 miles (28.260 kilometers)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The spacecraft came closest to any object so far in its nearly century-long travels.\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"the spacecraft came closest to any object so far in its nearly century-long travels\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Uranus appeared generally featureless.\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"Uranus itself appeared generally featureless\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The Challenger accident killed six astronauts during their space shuttle launch Feb. 28, 1986.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"the tragic Challenger accident that killed six astronauts during their space shuttle launch Feb. 28, 1986\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":78831,"type":"result","duration_ms":83051,"uuid":"91ca8e8a-a400-46ec-a0c3-1b16fd01f00f","ttft_stream_ms":895,"time_to_request_ms":120,"first_content_frame_ms":895,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
